// Hiding User Account Via SpecialAccounts Registry Key | T1564.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_special_accounts.yml
registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\ NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon\\SpecialAccounts\\UserList* AND winlog.event_data.Details:"DWORD \(0x00000000\)"
